Algorithm ComputeSepLevel(F, x, y):
  Input: Nested equiv family F with n+1 scales, elements x, y
  Output: sepLevel(x, y) in {0, ..., n}

  for i = 0 to n:
    if F.rel(i, x, y):
      return i
  // unreachable: F.rel(n, x, y) always holds

Time: O(n * R) where R = cost of checking rel

