Algorithm BuildClustering(F):
  Input: Nested equiv family F on finite alpha with n+1 scales
  Output: Hierarchical clustering

  for each scale i = 0 to n:
    for each x in alpha:
      cluster[i][x] = {y in alpha | F.rel(i, x, y)}
  return cluster

Time: O(n * |alpha|^2 * R)
